    {
      "source": "<code>WebDelegatingSmartContextLoader</code> is a concrete implementation of\n<a href=\"../support/AbstractDelegatingSmartContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>AbstractDelegatingSmartContextLoader</code></a> that delegates to a\n<a href=\"GenericXmlWebContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>GenericXmlWebContextLoader</code></a> (or a <a href=\"GenericGroovyXmlWebContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>GenericGroovyXmlWebContextLoader</code></a> if\nGroovy is present on the classpath) and an <a href=\"AnnotationConfigWebContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>AnnotationConfigWebContextLoader</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>WebDelegatingSmartContextLoader</code> 是 <a href=\"../support/AbstractDelegatingSmartContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>AbstractDelegatingSmartContextLoader</code></a> 的一个具体实现，它委托给一个 <a href=\"GenericXmlWebContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>GenericXmlWebContextLoader</code></a>（如果类路径中存在 Groovy，则委托给 <a href=\"GenericGroovyXmlWebContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>GenericGroovyXmlWebContextLoader</code></a>）和一个 <a href=\"AnnotationConfigWebContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>AnnotationConfigWebContextLoader</code></a>。",
